## Original Content
A secção açoriana do partido considera que é fundamental esclarecer a questão com a máxima urgência, tendo em conta que o transporte escolar constituiu uma função pública cuja continuidade deve ser assegurada sem interrupções

## Summary
The Azorean section of the Left Bloc party is urgently questioning the government about school transport in São Miguel. They stress that school transport is a public service that must continue without interruptions.

## Key Points
- The Left Bloc's Azorean branch is demanding urgent government clarification on school transport.
- School transport is identified as a critical public service.
- Continuity of this service without interruptions is a priority.
- The issue is specifically related to São Miguel in the Azores.


